  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the butter and let it melt, then add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the trout fillets, skin side up, and cook for 3-4 minutes or until crispy.",
    "Flip the trout over and cook for an additional 3-4 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Remove the trout from the skillet and set aside.",
    "Add the white wine to the skillet and cook until reduced by half.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice, parsley, salt, and pepper.",
    "Return the trout to the skillet and spoon the sauce over the top.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
